# Package and smoke test
@scenario tutorial_lesson_42
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[stage clear]
[show ginger beside_code thoughtful]
[set tutorial_source scripts/tutorial/42_release_smoke_check.vns]
[set tutorial_excerpt probe]
[set ui.dialogueFacet tutorial_code]
ginger: A release check should exercise your entry point and packaged assets. Here is a probe that depends on a picture and a short sound.
> Run the asset probe -> probe
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Practice exercise -> practice
> Review question -> check
@label probe
# region probe
[bg room]
[show ginger guide thoughtful]
[sfx assets/tutorial/welcome.wav]
# endregion
ginger: You should see the room and my thoughtful sprite, and hear a cue. Now run the exported build and try the same exercise.
ginger: Open the topic map, play this probe, save, close the game and load the save. You have checked navigation, assets and persistence in the build players receive.
> Run the probe again -> probe
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label return_hub
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
[if !tutorial_done_42]
[flag tutorial_done_42]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_8]
[end]

@label practice
[show ginger beside_code thoughtful]
[set ui.dialogueFacet tutorial_code]
ginger: The sprite loads but you hear no cue. Which check narrows it down?
> Rename the background. -> practice_hint
> Check the effect volume and the packaged WAV path. -> practice_result
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label practice_hint
ginger: Use the same effect settings in the editor and package, then verify the asset path.
[jump practice]
@label practice_result
ginger: Use the same effect settings in the editor and package, then verify the asset path.
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
> Review question -> check
> Try the interactive lab again -> start
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
[clear ui.dialogueFacet]
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: Which check exercises the exported build?
> Launch the package and run the asset probe. -> correct
> Check the source file name alone. -> retry
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: The package must resolve its runtime assets and navigation.
[jump check]
@label correct
ginger: The package must resolve its runtime assets and navigation.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
